<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Rajendra Narayan Singh Deo</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1912">1912</a>–<a href="/years/1975">1975</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Rajendra Narayan Singh Deo was the last ruling <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maharaja">Maharaja</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/patna">Patna</a>, a princely state in western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/odisha">Orissa</a>, which merged into Orissa in 1948. He then entered politics as a leader of the Ganatantra Parishad and the Swatantra Party, and served as Chief Minister of Orissa from 1967 to 1971.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rajendra-narayan-singh-deo.jpg" alt="Rajendra Narayan Singh Deo" width="110" height="125" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Government of Odisha · CC BY 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:RNS-Deo.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
